# Gardenize's "whenever a creature you control dies" is a leaves-the-battlefield ability: it looks back to the board as it
# was before the event (CR 603.10a), so a creature dying at the same time as Hushbringer, Hushbringer included, doesn't
# cause it to trigger (Hushbringer's rulings). Bot1 casts Gardenize, Ornithopter and Hushbringer on turn 1; on turn 3
# Pyroclasm kills Hushbringer and the Ornithopter together, and Gardenize gets no charge counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Gardenize
Hushbringer
Ornithopter
Pyroclasm
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
